title: Negotiations with Greece
view-if: cyprus_mode != 0 and cyprus_atilla1_ending_seen == 1 and cyprus_campaign_resolved == 0
new-page: true

= Negotiations with Greece

Attitude: [+ greece_attitude : cyprus_attitude +]. Diplomatic leverage: [+ leverage_points +].

Denktaş proposes a northern Turkish and southern Greek federal structure. Güneş proposes six geographically separate autonomous Turkish cantons within a federal Cyprus.

- @improve: Improve diplomatic confidence (1 Leverage Point; 2 days).
- @denktas: Negotiate support for the Denktaş Plan.
- @gunes: Negotiate support for the Güneş Plan.
- @ratify_denktas: Conclude the Denktaş settlement.
- @ratify_gunes: Conclude the Güneş settlement.
- @return: Return to the campaign.

@improve
view-if: cyprus_campaign_version != 2
choose-if: {! return AnatolianRules.cyprusCampaign.diplomacyUnavailable(Q,'greece','improve')===''; !}
subtitle: 1 diplomatic leverage.
unavailable-subtitle: Requires 1 Leverage Point, a country below Very Friendly and one of the four outreach turns between August 1 and 8.
on-arrival: {! AnatolianRules.cyprusCampaign.diplomaticAction(Q,'greece','improve'); !}
new-page: true

= Diplomatic report

[+ cyprus_campaign_last_text +]

- @return: Return to the campaign.

@denktas
view-if: cyprus_campaign_version != 2
choose-if: {! return AnatolianRules.cyprusCampaign.diplomacyUnavailable(Q,'greece','denktas')===''; !}
subtitle: 1 diplomatic leverage.
unavailable-subtitle: Requires leverage and the relevant military, airport, UN and foreign-attitude conditions. Outreach has a three-day cooldown; a country cannot endorse the same plan twice.
on-arrival: {! AnatolianRules.cyprusCampaign.diplomaticAction(Q,'greece','denktas'); !}
new-page: true

= Diplomatic report

[+ cyprus_campaign_last_text +]

- @return: Return to the campaign.

@gunes
view-if: cyprus_campaign_version != 2
choose-if: {! return AnatolianRules.cyprusCampaign.diplomacyUnavailable(Q,'greece','gunes')===''; !}
subtitle: 2 diplomatic leverage.
unavailable-subtitle: Requires leverage and the relevant military, airport, UN and foreign-attitude conditions. Outreach has a three-day cooldown; a country cannot endorse the same plan twice.
on-arrival: {! AnatolianRules.cyprusCampaign.diplomaticAction(Q,'greece','gunes'); !}
new-page: true

= Diplomatic report

[+ cyprus_campaign_last_text +]

- @return: Return to the campaign.

@return
go-to: cyprus_campaign_continue

@ratify_denktas
view-if: cyprus_campaign_version != 2
choose-if: {! return AnatolianRules.cyprusCampaign.canSettle(Q,'denktas'); !}
unavailable-subtitle: Requires all three endorsements and the military, airport, UN and conference conditions.
on-arrival: {! AnatolianRules.cyprusCampaign.settle(Q,'Denktaş Plan'); !}
go-to: cyprus_campaign_final

@ratify_gunes
view-if: cyprus_campaign_version != 2
choose-if: {! return AnatolianRules.cyprusCampaign.canSettle(Q,'gunes'); !}
unavailable-subtitle: Requires all three endorsements, strong UN cooperation and three conference breakthroughs.
on-arrival: {! AnatolianRules.cyprusCampaign.settle(Q,'Güneş Plan'); !}
go-to: cyprus_campaign_final
